{
  "declaredLength": 7020,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Combien de fois je vais devoir le répéter ?\nLa meilleure altération de statut, c’est le <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>poison <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 109
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ça fait baisser les PV petit à petit,\nc’est la meilleure stratégie pour gagner !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quelles sottises ! Rien n’arrive à la cheville\nde la <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>paralysie<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>, c’est l’évidence même !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La paralysie réduit la vitesse de déplacement\nd’un Pokémon !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006100200070006100720061006C00790073006900650020007200E900640075006900740020006C0061002000760069007400650073007300650020006400650020006400E90070006C006100630065006D0065006E0074000A006420190075006E00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200021001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il suffit alors de profiter de sa lenteur pour\nle vaincre d’un seul élan, et avec élégance !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hé, toi ! Tu tombes à pic !\nTu écoutais notre conversation, pas vrai ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aide-nous à trancher ! Qu’est-ce qui est le mieux,\nle poison ou la paralysie ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais nous devons être sûres que tu sais de quoi\nnous parlons. Commençons par un combat !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eh bien ? Es-tu prêt<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe à départager le poison\net la paralysie ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500680020006200690065006E0020003F002000450073002D0074007500200070007200EA007400100003110000FF01000065002000E00020006400E9007000610072007400610067006500720020006C006500200070006F00690073006F006E000A006500740020006C006100200070006100720061006C00790073006900650020003F001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ouvrirai le bal avec ma spécialité : la paralysie !\nQue le combat commence !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En garde !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E002000670061007200640065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pas tout de suite.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500061007300200074006F00750074002000640065002000730075006900740065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ha ! La peur de m’affronter te paralyse déjà ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480061002000210020004C0061002000700065007500720020006400650020006D20190061006600660072006F006E00740065007200200074006500200070006100720061006C0079007300650020006400E9006A00E00020003F001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La paralysie ralentit la vitesse de déplacement\ndes Pokémon affectés !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il suffit alors de les attaquer, ils n’auront pas\nle temps de réagir !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le poison est la stratégie la plus efficace, mais je\nla laisse t’affronter en premier, si ça lui fait plaisir.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 115
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je reconnais ma défaite...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020007200650063006F006E006E0061006900730020006D00610020006400E900660061006900740065002E002E002E001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Attention, car la paralysie ne disparaît pas,\nmême après la fin du combat !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si l’un de tes Pokémon est paralysé,\nsoigne-le à l’aide d’un Anti-Para !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La paralysie ne t’a pas empêché<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe de gagner !\nTu sembles être un<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe adversaire digne de ce nom...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 109
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais c’est mon tour, maintenant ! Le poison me\ngarantira la victoire, lentement mais sûrement !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0019>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00190000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est l’heure de goûter au poison ! Tu es prêt<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004320190065007300740020006C20190068006500750072006500200064006500200067006F00FB00740065007200200061007500200070006F00690073006F006E0020002100200054007500200065007300200070007200EA007400100003110000FF010000650020003F001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En garde !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E002000670061007200640065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pas tout de suite.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500061007300200074006F00750074002000640065002000730075006900740065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le poison te fait si peur que ça ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500200070006F00690073006F006E00200074006500200066006100690074002000730069002000700065007500720020007100750065002000E700610020003F001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les Pokémon empoisonnés perdent\nprogressivement des PV.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C0065007300200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200065006D0070006F00690073006F006E006E00E90073002000700065007200640065006E0074000A00700072006F00670072006500730073006900760065006D0065006E00740020006400650073002000500056002E001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et tu vas vite comprendre pourquoi\nc’est si terrifiant !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045007400200074007500200076006100730020007600690074006500200063006F006D007000720065006E00640072006500200070006F0075007200710075006F0069000A00632019006500730074002000730069002000740065007200720069006600690061006E007400200021001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si l’un de tes Pokémon est paralysé, n’oublie pas\nque tu peux le soigner à l’aide d’un Anti-Para !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\"",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00220000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je m’attendais à ce que tu battes Lysie...\nmais pas à ce que tu me battes moi aussi !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alors, qu’est-ce qui t’a donné le plus de\nfil à retordre ? Le poison ou la paralysie ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La paralysie !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006100200070006100720061006C0079007300690065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le poison !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500200070006F00690073006F006E002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ni l’un ni l’autre !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E00690020006C20190075006E0020006E00690020006C201900610075007400720065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quoi ?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 4960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00510075006F00690020003F0021001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah, tu vois ! Je ne cesse de le répéter...\nLa meilleure stratégie, c’est la paralysie !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 4984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah, bien sûr ! Ha ha, je le savais !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068002C0020006200690065006E0020007300FB007200200021002000480061002000680061002C0020006A00650020006C0065002000730061007600610069007300200021001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais enfin !\nLa paralysie est infiniment supérieure au poison !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00610069007300200065006E00660069006E00200021000A004C006100200070006100720061006C0079007300690065002000650073007400200069006E00660069006E0069006D0065006E0074002000730075007000E900720069006500750072006500200061007500200070006F00690073006F006E00200021001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pardon... ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 5388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006100720064006F006E002E002E002E0020003F001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu veux dire que tu ne crains aucune altération\nde statut ?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 5420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540075002000760065007500780020006400690072006500200071007500650020007400750020006E006500200063007200610069006E007300200061007500630075006E006500200061006C007400E90072006100740069006F006E000A0064006500200073007400610074007500740020003F0021001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Certes, aucune de nous n’a réussi à te battre...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 5552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004300650072007400650073002C00200061007500630075006E00650020006400650020006E006F007500730020006E201900610020007200E90075007300730069002000E00020007400650020006200610074007400720065002E002E002E001000020114012F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nous avons encore beaucoup à apprendre...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 5660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00750073002000610076006F006E007300200065006E0063006F00720065002000620065006100750063006F00750070002000E0002000610070007000720065006E006400720065002E002E002E001000020114012E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et il nous reste plein d’altérations de statut\net de capacités à découvrir !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 5752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si l’un de tes Pokémon souffre encore\nd’une altération de statut, tu devrais<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nle soigner avec un Total Soin.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 5916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 115
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ce médicament soigne toutes les altérations\nde statut. C’est un incontournable !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 6148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pour le bien des Pokémon, il est essentiel\nde soigner rapidement les altérations de statut.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 6320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Souviens-t’en. Ça pourrait t’être utile la prochaine\nfois que tu écouteras une conversation !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕį",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 6512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿5",
